  "details": "**Summary:** Camera sometimes immediately engages flight mode when opened after launching the client in desktop mode.\n\n**Frequency:** Intermittent but inconsistent (seen at least twice during current beta cycle).\n\n**Notes:** Happens without holding middle mouse wheel. No repro methods available as all attempts to repro have failed so far. Camera lens spawns immediately in flight mode and at root of avatar when this issue occurs. Happens regardless of whichever available methods used to open the camera. Camera also steals mouse input while it is open disrupting use of the camera while the issue is occurring; pressing the Windows key is required to restore normal control.",
